decisive push overnight: NZDJPY stays two-sided.|A haven-flavoured franc and a sleepy kiwi keep NZDCHF in a narrow stand-off.|Oil's bounce helped the loonie, but NZDCAD's bullish read could still get even stronger.|CADJPY stays under pressure: the yen's weakening condition from Monday's rally still stands.|Bearish CADCHF holds: oil gave the loonie a lift, the franc kept its haven glow.|Two havens, two quiet nights: CHFJPY stays two-sided.|Gold slid another 2.7% on Tuesday, but XAUUSD's fundamental read is still two-sided.")
